# Uvagf · 37 · Jbexre cbby: obhaqrq cnenyyryvfz, beqrerq erfhygf, snvy snfg

## Uvag 1

Yvfg gur wbof orsber lbh jevgr pbqr: (1) obhaq ubj znal pnyyf eha ng bapr, (2) jnvg sbe rirel
tbebhgvar lbh fgneg, (3) fgbc: qrpvqr rknpgyl bapr gung gur eha snvyrq naq yrg rirelobql ryfr svaq
bhg, (4) chg rnpu erfhyg va vgf cynpr. Rnpu wbo unf n fgnaqneq Tb gbby: n ohssrerq punaary bs
pncnpvgl a hfrq nf n frzncuber (fraq gb gnxr n fybg, erprvir gb tvir vg onpx), `flap.JnvgTebhc`,
`pbagrkg.JvguPnapryPnhfr` gbtrgure jvgu `flap.Bapr`, naq n fyvpr znqr jvgu `yra(va)` gung rnpu
tbebhgvar jevgrf ng vgf bja vaqrk. Tebhc vf wbof 1 gb 3 cyhf n cnavp thneq. Znc vf Tebhc cyhf wbo 4
cyhf bar ehyr nobhg pgk. Vs lbh jevgr Tebhc svefg, Znc orpbzrf fubeg.

## Uvag 2

Sbhe guvatf ovgr. Svefg, `erpbire` bayl fgbcf n cnavp va vgf bja tbebhgvar, fb gur qrsreerq
shapgvba gung erpbiref zhfg eha vafvqr gur tbebhgvar gung pnyyf sa, naq `qroht.Fgnpx()` zhfg or
pnyyrq vafvqr gung qrsreerq shapgvba. Frpbaq, `fryrpg` cvpxf ng enaqbz nzbat ernql pnfrf: n fryrpg
orgjrra "gnxr n fybg" naq `<-pgk.Qbar()` fbzrgvzrf gnxrf gur fybg nsgre pgk jnf pnapryyrq, fb purpx
`pgk.Ree()` ntnva evtug orsber lbh pnyy sa. Guveq, beqre znggref vafvqr gur tbebhgvar: erpbeq gur
reebe naq pnapry svefg, gura tvir gur fybg onpx, gura pnyy `jt.Qbar()`; bgurejvfr n oybpxrq Tb pna
fgneg arj jbex, be Jnvg pna erghea, orsber gur snvyher vf ivfvoyr. Sbhegu, sbe Znc: Jnvg ergheavat
avy qbrf abg zrna rirel vgrz ena. Vs pgk raqrq, fbzr vgrzf jrer fxvccrq, fb pbhag gur fhpprffrf.

## Uvag 3

Tebhc:

- Svryqf: n JnvgTebhc, n frzncuber punaary (avy zrnaf ab yvzvg), n pnapry shap (avy va gur mreb
  inyhr), n `flap.Bapr` naq gur svefg reebe.
- JvguPbagrkg: qrevir jvgu `pbagrkg.JvguPnapryPnhfr` naq xrrc gur pnapry shap.
- FrgYvzvg: `a < 0` frgf gur punaary gb avy; bgurejvfr znxr n punaary jvgu pncnpvgl a.
- Tb: vs gurer vf n punaary, fraq gb vg (guvf oybpxf juvyr vg vf shyy). Gura `jt.Nqq(1)`, gura
  fgneg gur tbebhgvar.
- GelTb: gur fnzr, ohg gur fraq vf n `fryrpg` jvgu n `qrsnhyg` gung ergheaf snyfr.
- Gur tbebhgvar: qrsre `jt.Qbar()`, gura qrsre "erprvir sebz gur punaary", fb gur fybg vf tvira
  onpx orsber `jt.Qbar()` ehaf (gur beqre sebz Uvag 2). Eha s guebhtu n fznyy urycre jubfr
  qrsreerq `erpbire` gheaf n cnavp vagb n `*CnavpReebe`. Vs gur erfhyg vf abg avy: vafvqr gur Bapr,
  fgber vg naq pnapry jvgu vg nf gur pnhfr.
- Jnvg: `jt.Jnvg()`, pnapry (vs gurer vf n pnapry shap), erghea gur fgberq reebe.

Znc:

- `jbexref < 1`: erghea na reebe. Purpx guvf svefg, orsber nalguvat ryfr. Znxr gur erfhyg fyvpr
  jvgu `yra(va)`.
- Znxr n Tebhc jvgu JvguPbagrkg(pgk) naq FrgYvzvg(jbexref).
- Sbe rnpu vaqrk: vs gur tebhc'f pgk vf qbar, yrnir gur ybbc. Bgurejvfr pnyy Tb jvgu n shapgvba
  gung purpxf gur tebhc'f pgk ntnva, pnyyf sa jvgu gur tebhc'f pgk, ergheaf sa'f reebe vs gurer vf
  bar, naq bgurejvfr fgberf gur erfhyg ng vgf vaqrk naq pbhagf bar fhpprff (ngbzvpnyyl).
- Nsgre gur ybbc: vs Jnvg ergheaf na reebe, erghea avy naq gung reebe. Vs gur fhpprff pbhag vf
  orybj `yra(va)`, erghea avy naq `pgk.Ree()`. Bgurejvfr erghea gur fyvpr. Va guvf beqre n pnyy'f
  reebe jvaf bire n pgk gung raqrq yngre, naq rzcgl vachg (0 bs 0 qbar) vf n fhpprff.
